SF0060 Sales tax distribution rates.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) French, Ide, Laursen, D, McKeown, Salazar
and Smith, D and Representative(s) Allemand, Banks,
Strock, Webber and Winter
AN ACT relating to sales and use tax; revising the distribution rates for sales
and use taxes; removing obsolete statutory language; specifying applicability;
and providing for an effective date.
